name: {{SKILL_NAME}}
description: {{SKILL_DESCRIPTION}}
---

# {{Skill Display Name}}

{{PROJECT_CONTEXT}}

## {{SECTION_1_HEADING}}

{{SECTION_1_CONTENT}}

## {{SECTION_2_HEADING}}

{{SECTION_2_CONTENT}}

